# Curation sources — the CSVs, spreadsheets and scripts the bundled datasets are compiled from.
# The plugin ships the compiled JSON in src/main/resources; these stay local.
# Anchored to the repo root: a bare "data/" also swallowed src/**/core/data/, which silently kept
# a source file out of git and shipped a repo that did not compile.
/data/

